\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian Money Market Rates Up Early On Fear Of Bank Runs \b0\par\par\uc2 327 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1999\par 03:53\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Indonesian money market rates were mostly higher in cautious dealings early Tuesday as banks limited their lending in the interbank market on fears that the delay of bank recapitalization may spark a run on banks, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers added that some large depositors Monday transferred their deposits from local banks to foreign banks. As a result, foreign banks are enjoying good liquidity, while some medium-and small-sized local banks are facing liquidity shortage. \par \par \uc2  On Friday the government delayed the announcement for two weeks of a bank recapitalization program, which included planned closures of banks ineligible for recapitalization. A reason given, among others, was to give banks a chance to improve their business plans. \par \par \uc2  "Depositors are afraid that their banks can't afford the current negative spread (between lending and deposit rates) any longer and may face closure," said a dealer with a joint venture bank. \par \par \uc2  At 0220 GMT, the overnight interbank rate - considered the benchmark rate - was between 32% and 33% for foreign and secured joint venture banks, unchanged from Monday. Secure local banks are bidding for the overnight rupiah at between 34% and 35%, up from between 33% and 34% Monday. Less secure local banks are paying overnight rates between 50% and 55%, up from between 48% and 50%. \par \par \uc2  In the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets at the same time, the dollar was trading at 8,870 rupiah (IDR), little changed from IDR8,875 late Monday in Asia. \par \par \uc2  Earlier, Bank Indonesia injected IDR2.820 trillion rupiah into the money market. The injection represents the reversal of a Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's recent \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the money market. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par In its daily \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  kept the overnight rate at\par 30%; two, three and six day rates at 33%; and one week rate at 34%.\par    -By I Made Sentana (62-21) 3983 1277;imsentana@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 02-03-99\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0253GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv3201p2p\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
