\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian Money Market Rates Fall On Increased Liquidity \b0\par\par\uc2 241 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 Februar 1999\par 04:44\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Indonesian money market rates were mostly lower early Thursday as liquidity increased after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  released a net 1.90 trillion rupiah (IDR) into the market earlier in the day. \par \par \uc2  At 0310 GMT, the overnight interbank rate - considered the benchmark rate - was between 31% and 34%, down slightly from between 32% and 35% Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia's liquidity injection came from the expiration of Sertifikat Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  notes it had absorbed in previous money market \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  totaling IDR13.401 trillion. Meanwhile, the settlement of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  notes auctioned Wednesday absorbed IDR11.5 trillion back out of the system. \par \par \uc2  Apart from Bank Indonesia's liquidity injection, foreign banks as well as some joint-venture and local banks received deposits being transferred from ailing banks seen targeted for closure Saturday. \par \par \uc2  "We have been witnessing increased transfer of funds from smaller banks since early this week," a dealer with a joint-venture bank said. \par \par \uc2  In order to absorb excess liquidity, Bank Indonesia is conducting money market \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 . It keeps the overnight rate at 30%; four-, five-, and six-day rates at 33% and one-week rate at 34%. \par \par \uc2  In the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market early Wednesday, the dollar was trading at IDR8,800, down a touch from IDR8,820 late Wednesday in Asia. \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana (62-21) 3500145 imsentana@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 25-02-99 \par \par \uc2  0344GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv2p01jr9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
