\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian Money Market Rates Flat; Banks Reduce Lending \b0\par\par\uc2 298 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Februar 1999\par 03:20\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Indonesian money market rates are mostly steady early Monday as liquidity stays easy although banks reduced their lending to other banks ahead of the bank closure Saturday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said banks, which are expected to be shut down, are facing difficulties in finding rupiah from other banks and therefore they are bidding for liquidity at much higher rates than safe banks. \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia's Governor Sjahril Sabirin told Dow Jones Newswires late Friday that he expected less than 40 banks will be shut down. \par \par \uc2  At 0151 GMT (8:51 p.m. EST Sunday), the overnight interbank rate - considered the benchmark rate - was between 32% and 34% for foreign, joint venture and safe local banks, unchanged from Friday. Whereas, those banks seen targeted for closure are bidding for the overnight rupiah rate at between 50% and 60%, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "I think until the end of the month banks will remain cautious in lending their rupiah to other banks," said a dealer with a local bank. "I expect interest rates to climb to the run up of the bank closure announcement." \par \par \uc2  Earlier, Bank Indonesia injected 3.018 trillion rupiah (IDR) into the money market. The injection represents the reversal of Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's daily \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the money market. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Monday, kept the overnight rate at 30%, two, three, and four day rates at 33%, and one-week rate at 34%. \par \par \uc2  In \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets at the same time, the dollar was trading at IDR8,910 rupiah (IDR), up from IDR8,850 late Friday. \par \par \uc2  In the swap market meanwhile, the premium on the overnight contract was steady at IDR5/IDR6. \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana (62-21) 3500145 imsentana@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 22-02-99 \par \par \uc2  0220GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv2m01cxk\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
