\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian Money Market Rates Flat As Liquidity Remains Easy \b0\par\par\uc2 218 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 Februar 1999\par 02:36\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Indonesian money market rates were steady early Thursday with liquidity remaining easy, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia injected 1.344 trillion rupiah (IDR) into the money market early Thursday, keeping liquidity ample. \par \par \uc2  At 0109 GMT, the overnight interbank rate - considered the benchmark rate - was between 31% and 33%, unchanged from Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  "The market is quiet, everyone seems to have good liquidity in their hands," a dealer with a local bank said. \par \par \uc2  To absorb excess liquidity, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  conducts a daily money market \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2 . It set the overnight rate at 30%, two-, five- and six-day rates at 33%, and one-week rate at 34%. \par \par \uc2  Besides the regular \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers expect Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  by offering overnight money at 32% to tighten liquidity. Bank Indonesia has been paying a 32% overnight rate to tighten liquidity, which grew significantly during the Muslim Idul Fitri holiday in late January. \par \par \uc2  In the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets early Thursday, the dollar was fetching IDR8,600, down slightly from IDR8,625 late Wednesday in Asia. \par \par \uc2  In the swap market meanwhile, the premium of the overnight swap was unchanged at IDR5.25/IDR6.25. \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana (62-21) 3500145 imsentana@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 11-02-99 \par \par \uc2  0136GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv2b013rb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
