\par\par \b \uc2  Bank  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2  says "small"  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  continues. \b0\par\par\uc2 237 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Januar 1999\par 11:44\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, Jan 28 (Reuters) - Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Sjahril Sabirin said on Thursday current weakness in the rupiah was temporary and \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was continuing. \par \par \uc2  "This is temporary," Sabirin told reporters when asked about the recent weakening of the rupiah. \par \par \uc2  "Small \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is continuing." \par \par \uc2  Sabirin said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would do its best to support the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . He gave no further details. \par \par \uc2  He said earlier this week the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would try to lift the rupiah to 8,000 against the dollar. Indonesia's 1999/2000 budget assumes an average exchange rate of 7,500 to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah edged lower against the dollar on Thursday as the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  gained against the yen, with dealers watching parliament to see whether laws paving the way for elections set for June would be passed. \par \par \uc2  Indonesia's political parties, after weeks of wrangling, have agreed most of the main points of new laws which will form the basis of parliamentary elections scheduled for June 7, but a row over the role of civil servants in politics caused a delay in a vote on the laws on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  By 1010 GMT the rupiah was quoted at 9,175/9,250 compared with 9,120/9,220 late on Wednesday. ((Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364; Fax +6221 344-8404, 