\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian Money Mkt Up; Bk Indonesia Borrowing Rupiah \b0\par\par\uc2 263 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Januar 1999\par 03:30\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Despite ample liquidity, Indonesian money-market rates were mostly higher early Tuesday, as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is paying banks higher than its regular \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates if they place their rupiah with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  As well as its regular \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  to borrow rupiah at predetermined rates, Bank Indonesia Monday afternoon borrowed rupiah at rates determined by the market. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  paid 32% interest on overnight money - higher than its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate of 30%. \par \par \uc2  An official at Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  confirmed that it paid 32% for overnight rupiah. Bank Indonesia will continue to do so Tuesday, in order to absorb excess liquidity from the market, he added. \par \par \uc2  "The amount of base money in circulation increased sharply during the (Muslim) Idul Fitri holiday last week," the official said. "We have to absorb the excess." \par \par \uc2  At 0206 GMT (9:06 p.m. Monday EST), tracking Bank Indonesia's rate, the overnight interbank rate - considered the benchmark rate - was between 31% and 32%, up from between 30% and 31% Monday. \par \par \uc2  Earlier Tuesday, Bank Indonesia injected 4.308 trillion rupiah (IDR) into the money market, as previous days' borrowings from the market matured. \par \par \uc2  In the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market at 0206 GMT, the dollar was trading at IDR9,163, down from IDR9,300 late Monday. \par \par \uc2  In the swap market, the overnight swap rate inched up to IDR5.50-IDR6.50, from IDR5-IDR6 Monday, tracking money-market rates. \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana (62-21) 3500145 imsentana@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 26-01-99 \par \par \uc2  0230GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv1q00kp8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
