\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian Money Market Rates Flat: Liquidity Remains Ample \b0\par\par\uc2 254 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Januar 1999\par 03:28\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Indonesian money market rates are mostly flat early Friday as a liquidity injection from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  earlier in the day keeps liquidity ample, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia injected 4.130 trillion (IDR) rupiah into the money market early Friday with the expiration of Sertifikat Bank Indonesia (SBI), Bank Indonesia's short-term notes. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said that no banks were dealing in overnight maturities as they don't know if Bank Indonesia will be open for clearing on Monday. \par \par \uc2  "The active dealings took place on six-day maturities," said a dealer with a joint-venture bank. \par \par \uc2  At 0205 GMT (9:05 p.m. EST Thursday), the six-day interbank rate was between 32% and 33%, taking a lead from Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's money market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate at 32% for six-day tenure. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said that healthy demand for liquidity ahead of the Muslim Idul Fitri Holiday Tuesday and Wednesday was well covered. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The market will be closed during those days. It will open again\par Thursday.\par    In the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets at the same time, the dollar was\par trading at IDR9,100, up from IDR8,675 Thursday as the effective\par devaluation of the Brazilian real Wednesday continues to shake the\par rupiah.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par In the onshore swap market, the premium on the overnight swap was at\par IDR40/IDR45. The high rate reflects the five-day market closure.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -By I Made