\par\par \b \uc2  ASIA  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2  - Quietly easier start for regionals. \b0\par\par\uc2 540 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Januar 1999\par 02:19\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      0100 GMT - Asian regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  got off a generally \par \par \uc2  easier start even though the dollar was a little easier against \par \par \uc2  the yen as worries continued about Brazil and impeachment \par \par \uc2  proceedings against President Clinton. \par \par \uc2      Asian markets seem to still be shrugging off the Brazil \par \par \uc2  devaluation despite the fact the Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was \par \par \uc2  forced to come in and defend the embattled \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2      Analysts are talking about a much bigger devaluation to \par \par \uc2  come in Brazil but for now the Asian regional markets seem to \par \par \uc2  be taking the bad news from Latin America in their stride. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders will be keeping a close eye on the stock \par \par \uc2  markets again today to see if that 2.45 percent drop in the Dow \par \par \uc2  will cause some overseas cash to be pulled out of regional \par \par \uc2  stocks. \par \par \uc2      *** The rupiah stood out with a continued slide to the \par \par \uc2  9,000 level with the market getting nervous about trouble on \par \par \uc2  the streets during the forthcoming public holiday. \par \par \uc2      Although the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  vowed to step in and defend the \par \par \uc2  rupiah, \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  has yet to be seen. \par \par \uc2      Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Syahril Sabirin has said the \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would seek to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to keep the rupiah firmer \par \par \uc2  than 8,000 to the dollar. Indonesia's budget for the 1999/2000 \par \par \uc2  fiscal year forecasts an average rupiah rate of 7,500. \par \par \uc2      Worries over Brazil have been compounded by domestic \par \par \uc2  political uncertainty. \par \par \uc2      Students have pledged to resume mass anti-government \par \par \uc2  protests after the Eid al-Fitr Moslem festival on January \par \par \uc2  19/20, raising concerns of further bloodshed on the streets of \par \par \uc2  Jakarta. \par \par \uc2  *** The Singapore dollar stood out with another small rise \par \par \uc2  and dealers reported an unwinding of the long baht/short Sing \par \par \uc2  positions put on in recent weeks. \par \par \uc2  The low level of interest rates in Singapore prompted \par \par \uc2  investors to borrow Singapore dollars and convert them to other \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and much of this cheap funding went on in Sing/baht. \par \par \uc2      Singapore corporates have also been seen buying into \par \par \uc2  Thailand. \par \par \uc2      *** The Korean won was a little lower even though the Seoul \par \par \uc2  stock market continued to do well in the fact of the Brazilian \par \par \uc2  crisis. \par \par \uc2      *** Elsewhere, the Thai baht was easier alongside the \par \par \uc2  Philippine peso while the Taiwan dollar managed a small gain. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCIES\b0 \highlight\uc2  VS U.S. DOLLAR \par \par \uc2  Change on the day FRI 15 0115GMT \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ...Latest bid....Prev Close....Pct Move \par \par \uc2   Ringgit......3.7999.......3.8000..........0.00% \par \par \uc2   Rupiah......9025.00......8600.00.........-4.71% \par \par \uc2   Baht..........37.18........36.90.........-0.75% \par \par \uc2   Peso..........38.70........38.48.........-0.57% \par \p