\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia Rupiah Lower Late On Brazil And Domestic Politics \b0\par\par\uc2 347 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Januar 1999\par 11:12\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Indonesia's rupiah (IDR) was trading lower against the U.S. dollar in subdued dealings late Thursday. The rupiah was the hardest hit of regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the domino effect of Brazil's effective \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  devaluation Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  chief, Gustavo Franco, resigned Wednesday and his successor, Francisco Lopes, announced a widening of the trading band for the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the real. The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  immediately plunged 8.2% to BRR1.32 to the dollar, the floor of the new expanded trading band. \par \par \uc2  The combination of this and the country's high social and political risk dragged the rupiah down, revisiting levels seen two months ago. \par \par \uc2  After falling to a low of IDR8,800 to the dollar, the rupiah was trading at IDR8,675 to the dollar in the spot market at 0955 GMT (4:55 a.m. EST), down from its close Wednesday at IDR8,550 to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  "Singapore-based speculators are still bidding for the dollar in late trading, anticipating a follow through of selloffs on the rupiah during the London and New York trading hours," said a dealer with a joint venture bank in Jakarta. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said they didn't hear of Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market Thursday, despite the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's warning to the market that it will safeguard the rupiah. \par \par \uc2  The dollar's rise in the spot market, however, was slowed by declines in onshore swap rates, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  One month swap rates declined to IDR250/IDR300 late Thursday, from IDR300/IDR400 late Wednesday. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The rupiah's direction Friday will hinge on developments in Brazil,\par dealers said. They see the dollar trading between IDR8,500 and IDR9,000\par Friday. Offshore participants are expected to keep long dollar positions\par during the weekend on growing nervousness about a possible outbreak of\par social unrest in the country, after a relatively quiet period during the\par Muslim Ramadhan holiday.\par    -By I Made Sentana (62-21) 3500145 imsentana@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 14-01-99\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1012GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv1e00bbu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
