\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia Rupiah Dn Late Morning; Jolted By Brazil's Move \b0\par\par\uc2 285 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Januar 1999\par 03:55\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Indonesia's rupiah (IDR) fell against the U.S. dollar in late-morning dealing Thursday, as offshore participants are speculating against the rupiah following the Brazilian government's move to widen the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading band Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  After weakening to IDR8,800 to the dollar, a level not seen since early November, the rupiah was trading at IDR8,763 in the spot market at 0243 GMT (9:43 p.m. Wednesday EST), weaker than its close Wednesday at IDR8,550. \par \par \uc2  "Singapore-based speculators are driving the rupiah down, as they expect international hedge funds to continue unloading emerging-market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said a dealer at a joint-venture bank. \par \par \uc2  Dealers expect the rupiah to weaken as far as IDR9,000 Thursday, but they see the level as risky, as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  at that level. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Syahril Sabirin reiterated Wednesday that Bank Indonesia will be resolute in defending the rupiah. He said Bank Indonesia would curb the dollar below IDR8,000. \par \par \uc2  "The market is testing Bank Indonesia's resoluteness to defend the rupiah," said a dealer at a local bank. "The fact that Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  hasn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  encourages speculators to drive the rupiah lower." \par \par \uc2  Earlier in the day, some offshore participants took profit on the dollar, but the rupiah's flush liquidity in the money market is preventing the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  from strengthening. \par \par \uc2  Flush rupiah liquidity dragged money-market rates lower. The benchmark overnight rate fell to between 29% and 30%, from between 32% and 34% late Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana (62-21) 3500145 imsentana@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 14-01-99 \par \par \uc2  0255GMT \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv1e00atb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
