\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian Rupiah Ends Down;Hedge Funds Exit Emerging Mkts \b0\par\par\uc2 289 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Januar 1999\par 11:46\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--The Indonesian rupiah (IDR) closed lower against the dollar Wednesday in hectic trading as hedge funds unloaded emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  amid worries over Brazil's financial stability. \par \par \uc2  The market ignored the statement of Bank Indonesia Governor Syahril Sabirin, who reiterated that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will be steadfast in its effort to curb the dollar below 8,000 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  "We heard Bank Indonesia checking the (quotation) rate in Singapore, but it didn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said a dealer with a foreign bank in Jakarta. "I think Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  must \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , otherwise the three-month effort to stabilize the rupiah will be in vain." \par \par \uc2  After falling to a low of IDR8,650 to the dollar, a level not seen since early November, the rupiah closed at IDR8,550 to the dollar, down from its close Tuesday at IDR8,035. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah is also clouded by the dispute between the parliament and the government on the country's bank recapitalization program. The parliament Tuesday challenged the government's plan to recapitalize local commercial banks, saying that the financial burden that the state budget would have to shoulder is too high. \par \par \uc2  "The bickering could slow down the banking rehabilitation program," said a dealer with a local bank. "I, however, see the parliament trying to be critical to widen ... (its) constituency ahead of the public election in June." \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Hedge funds are expected to continue unloading emerging market\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Thursday, which is seen dragging the rupiah to IDR9,000 to\par the dollar , dealers said. Support for the rupiah is seen at IDR8,250.\par    -By I Made Sentana; 6221-350-0145; imsentana@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 13-01-99\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1046GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv1d009s7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
