\par\par \b \uc2  Bank Indonesia aims to lift rph through 8,000/dlr. \b0\par\par\uc2 199 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Januar 1999\par 04:53\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, Jan 13 (Reuters) - Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Wednesday it planned to continue \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to try to keep the rupiah firmer than 8,000 to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  "We will continue the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to keep the rupiah under (firmer than) 8,000," \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Syahril Sabirin told reporters ahead of a parliamentary hearing. \par \par \uc2  Sabirin said the rupiah's sudden drop had been caused by dollar strength. \par \par \uc2  "The dollar is now showing an uptrend against all other Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," he said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dived to 8,350/8,425 by 0350 GMT from 8,025/8,055 in late Jakarta trade on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers cited rumours in the market about a split within the military and concern over parliament's criticism of the 1999/2000 draft budget which was announced a week ago. \par \par \uc2  For months the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been converting around $5-15 million a day in aid and loan dollars into rupiah. Analysts say this has been a significant factor in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's strength. ((Gde Anugrah Arka, Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364; Fax +6221 344-8404, jakarta.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dv1d06qz9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
