\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian Money Mkt Rates Down Slightly On Flush Liquidity \b0\par\par\uc2 274 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Januar 1999\par 02:55\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Indonesian money market rates were slightly lower in quiet dealings early Wednesday as the market remains flush with liquidity ahead of the weekly auction of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's one-month note later in the day. \par \par \uc2  At 0146 GMT (8:46 p.m. Tuesday EST), the overnight interbank rate - considered the benchmark rate - was at 29.5%, down slightly from 30% a day earlier. \par \par \uc2  "Overnight rate fell slightly as there were a lot of offers for overnight maturity," said a dealer with a local bank. "Banks want to secure their rupiah back Thursday in case their bids for (Bank Indonesia notes) are accepted." \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia is inviting bids for its one-month Sertifikat Bank Indonesia to absorb 7 trillion rupiah (IDR). The settlement of the auction will be completed Thursday. \par \par \uc2  At last week's auction, SBI was yielding 35.52%, up from 35.28% a week earlier. \par \par \uc2  Earlier Wednesday, Bank Indonesia injected IDR4.740 trillion into the system. \par \par \uc2  To absorb excess liquidity as well as to prevent the rates from falling sharply, Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  is \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  by borrowing the rupiah from the market for tenures between one and seven days. \par \par \uc2  It sets the overnight rate at 28%; for tenures between two and five days at 31%; and seven days at 32%. \par \par \uc2  In the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets Wednesday morning, the dollar was trading flat at IDR7,850. \par \par \uc2  In the swap market, the premium on the overnight swap was unchanged at IDR5.50-6.00. \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana; (62-21) 3500145; imsentana@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 06-01-99 \par \par \uc2  0155GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv16002sm\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
