\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian Money Market Rates Flat On Ample Rupiah Liquidity \b0\par\par\uc2 234 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Januar 1999\par 03:20\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Indonesian money-market rates were mostly stable in quiet dealing early Tuesday, as ample rupiah (IDR) liquidity kept demand and supply well balanced. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said liquidity was good after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Bank Indonesia, injected IDR2.209 trillion into the system earlier in the day. \par \par \uc2  At 0206 GMT (9:06 p.m. Monday EST), the overnight interbank rate - considered the benchmark rate - was unchanged: at 29% for foreign banks; 30% for local secured banks; and 40% for ailing local banks. \par \par \uc2  "There is no problem with liquidity. Most companies have not fully started activities for the year, leaving demand for the rupiah well covered," said a dealer at a local bank. \par \par \uc2  To absorb excess liquidity and prevent the rates falling further, Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  is \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the money market by borrowing rupiah. It has set the overnight rate at 28%; the two-, three-, and six-day rate at 31%; and the one-week rate at 32%. \par \par \uc2  In the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets at the same time, the dollar was trading at IDR7,920 rupiah in the spot market, down slightly from IDR7,975 late Monday in Asia. \par \par \uc2  In the swap market, the premium on the overnight swap contract was stable, at IDR5.50-IDR6.50. \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana (62-21) 3500145 imsentana@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 05-01-99 \par \par \uc2  0220GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv1500218\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\pics