\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian Money Market Rates Flat Early In Slow Dealing \b0\par\par\uc2 217 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Januar 1999\par 03:45\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Indonesian money-market rates were mostly stable in quiet dealing early Monday, as the slow pace of business activity after the New Year left demand and supply for liquidity well balanced. \par \par \uc2  At 0218 GMT (9:18 p.m. Sunday EST), the overnight interbank rate - considered the benchmark rate - was at 30%, unchanged from Wednesday. The market was closed Thursday and Friday. \par \par \uc2  "Liquidity remains sufficient," said a dealer at a local bank. "The holiday mood has left the market peaceful." \par \par \uc2  Earlier in the day, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Bank Indonesia, injected 4.096 trillion rupiah (IDR) into the money market with the expiration of Sertifikat Bank Indonesia (SBI), Bank Indonesia's short-term notes. \par \par \uc2  To absorb excess liquidity, Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  is \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  by borrowing the rupiah from the market. It is offering 28% for overnight money, 31% for two, three, and four days, and 32% for one week. \par \par \uc2  In the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets at the same time, the dollar was fetching IDR8,075, virtually unchanged from Wednesday's level. \par \par \uc2  In the swap market, meanwhile, the premium on overnight swaps was also rock steady, at IDR5.50-IDR6.00 \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana (62-21) 3500145 imsentana@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 04-01-99 \par \par \uc2  0245GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv14000k9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
