\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian Money Market Rates Steady As Liquidity Sufficient \b0\par\par\uc2 254 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Dezember 1998\par 03:28\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Indonesian money market rates were mostly stable early Monday as liquidity remains sufficient. \par \par \uc2  Considering the stability of interest rates since last week, dealers expect interest rates to stay at current levels until the end of the year. \par \par \uc2  "It seems that Bank Indonesia (\b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is pleased with the current interest rate levels and it will maintain them at the levels," said a dealer with a joint venture bank in Jakarta. \par \par \uc2  At 0210 GMT (9:10 p.m. Sunday EST), the overnight interbank rate - considered the benchmark rate - was unchanged between 29% and 29.5% for foreign and joint venture banks, and between 30% and 31% for secured local banks. \par \par \uc2  Earlier in the day, Bank Indonesia injected 3.54 trillion rupiah (IDR) into the money market with the expiration of Sertifikat Bank Indonesia (SBI), Bank Indonesia's short-term notes. \par \par \uc2  To absorb excess liquidity, Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  is \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the money market by borrowing the rupiah for between overnight and one-week tenures. It set the overnight rate at 28%; the rate for between three and five days at 31%; and the one week rate at 33%. \par \par \uc2  In the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets at the same time, the dollar was trading sideways at IDR7,825 - IDR7,900 in quiet trading. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par In the swap market, meanwhile, the premium on the overnight contract\par was flat at IDR5/IDR6.\par    -By I Made Sentana (62-21) 3500145 imsentana@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \p