\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian rupiah softens, SBI auction rate down. \b0\par\par\uc2 205 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 Dezember 1998\par 11:46\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, Dec 23 (Reuters) - The Indonesian rupiah softened again on Wednesday as dealers said that with volume thinning ahead of Christmas, small moves were having a big impact. \par \par \uc2  They said small state bank dollar buying briefly sent the rupiah to 7,950 against the dollar in early trading, but \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  after the lunch break helped the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rebounded slightly to 7,800. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah ended at 7,775/7,875 against the dollar compared with Jakarta's Tuesday close of 7,725/7,775. \par \par \uc2  "Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  (the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) was likely to have \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market, by selling dollars from Singapore after the lunch break," one foreign bank dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said another fall in the average rate of Bank Indonesia's weekly auction of one-month SBI certificates did not have much impact on the market. \par \par \uc2  "The slight fall was as expected," another dealer said. \par \par \uc2  The weekly auction resulted in a weighted average interest rate of 35.28 percent, down from 35.63 percent last week, a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  official said on Wednesday. ((Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364; Fax +6221 344-8404, jakarta.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010926ducn01wb0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
