\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian Money Market Rates Up Early On Tighter Liquidity \b0\par\par\uc2 302 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 Dezember 1998\par 03:59\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Indonesian money market rates were mostly higher early Thursday on tighter rupiah liquidity, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  At 0222 GMT (9:22 p.m. Wednesday EST), the overnight interbank rate - considered the benchmark rate - rose to between 34% and 35% for foreign banks, from between 29% and 30% Wednesday, and to between 35% and 38% for secure local banks, up from between 30% and 33% a day earlier. \par \par \uc2  Liquidity was tighter as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Bank Indonesia, injected a meager 589 billion rupiah (IDR) ($1=IDR7,825) into the system, much lower than the usual amount ranging between IDR2 trillion and IDR3 trillion, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The relatively small liquidity injection was due to Bank Indonesia Wednesday accepting bids for its one-month note (SBI) of IDR9.68 trillion, higher than its original target of IDR8.5 trillion. \par \par \uc2  "I think Bank Indonesia is trying to tighten liquidity after the International Monetary Fund warned Indonesia not to let interest rates fall sharply," said a dealer with a foreign bank in Jakarta. \par \par \uc2  Most bidders didn't pay attention to the IMF's warning and they bid SBI notes at interest rates lower than last week's rate, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The one-month SBI note was yielding 35.63%, down from 37.86% at last week's auction. \par \par \uc2  To tighten liquidity further, Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  is \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the money market by borrowing rupiah for overnight tenure. The interest rate is 29%. \par \par \uc2  The premium on the overnight swap contract rose to IDR6/IDR8, from IDR5/IDR6 Wednesday, dealers said. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par In the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market, the dollar was fetching IDR7,850, up\par from IDR7,650 late Wednesday in Asia.\par    -By I Made Sentana (62-21) 3500145 imsentana@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 17-12-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0259GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010917duch0260r\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
