\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian Money Mkt Rates Flat Early On Weak Rupiah Demand \b0\par\par\uc2 280 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Dezember 1998\par 04:14\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Indonesian money market rates were mostly steady in quiet trade early Wednesday on weak year-end demand for rupiah, with most of the activities focused on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  At 0157 GMT (8:57 p.m. EST Monday), the overnight interbank rate - considered the benchmark rate - was stable at 29% for foreign banks and 30% to 32% for large local banks with better credit. \par \par \uc2  To absorb excess liquidity, Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  is \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to borrow the rupiah from the market for maturities between one and seven days. \par \par \uc2  It sets its overnight \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate at 29%, at 31% for periods between two and six days, and at 33% for one week. \par \par \uc2  Those \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates were unchanged from Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Earlier in the day the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Bank Indonesia, injected 2.178 trillion rupiah (IDR) into the market. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the approach to year-end has damped banks' interest to take on large positions, leading to weak demand for rupiah funds. \par \par \uc2  They said that most of the morning activity was in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market as the rupiah weakened against the dollar to IDR7,850 at 0238 GMT, from IDR7,605 late Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers suggest that the weakening was a combination of banks' worries over the country's political situation and the International Monetary Fund's statement cautioning against sharp fall in interest rates in Indonesia. \par \par \uc2  In the swap market, meanwhile, the premium on the overnight dollar-rupiah swap was unchanged at IDR4.50/IDR5.50, which is equal to 30%, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  -By Noel Fung; 6221-350-0145; nfung@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 16-12-98 \par \par \uc2  0314GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010917ducg020da\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
