\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian Money Market Rates Flat Early On Ample Liquidity \b0\par\par\uc2 274 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Dezember 1998\par 03:44\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Indonesian money market rates were mostly steady in quiet dealings early Tuesday as the system remains flush with liquidity, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Earlier in the day the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Bank Indonesia, injected 3.9 trillion rupiah (IDR) ($1=IDR7,550) into the market, keeping ample liquidity, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  At 0157 GMT (8:57 p.m. EST Monday), the overnight interbank rate - considered the benchmark rate - was stable at 31% for foreign and joint venture banks, and between 31% to 33% for large local banks with relatively sounder fundamentals than most of the nation's banks. \par \par \uc2  "Although liquidity is ample, many ailing banks find it hard to borrow the rupiah following rumors that one small bank failed to pay back its interbank debt," said a dealer with a local bank. \par \par \uc2  To absorb excess liquidity Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  is \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  by borrowing the rupiah from the market early Tuesday for maturities between one and seven days. It sets its overnight rate at 29%, at 31% for period between two and six days, and at 33% for one week. \par \par \uc2  Dealers don't expect demand for the rupiah to surge ahead of the year end due to the prolonged slow down in economic activities. \par \par \uc2  In \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets at the same time, the dollar was steady at IDR7,550 in quiet trading. \par \par \uc2  In the swap market meanwhile, the premium on the overnight dollar-rupiah swap was unchanged at IDR4.50/IDR5.50, which is equal to 30%, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  