\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian Money Market Rates Down Early As Liquidity Flush \b0\par\par\uc2 263 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 Dezember 1998\par 03:14\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Indonesian money market rates were mostly lower early Friday as the market was flush with liquidity after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  injected 8.884 trillion rupiah (IDR) into the market. \par \par \uc2  As reported earlier, the expiration of Bank Indonesia notes (SBIs) added IDR8.884 trillion in liquidity to the market, which was already flush with supply Thursday. \par \par \uc2  At 0134 GMT (8:34 p.m. EST Thursday), the overnight interbank rate - considered the benchmark rate - was down to 29% for foreign and joint venture banks, from 30% Thursday. Local banks with good names obtained the overnight rupiah between 29.5% and 33%, down from between 30% and 35% Thursday. \par \par \uc2  To absorb excess liquidity, Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  is \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  by borrowing the rupiah overnight and for one week. The interest rate it's offering for overnight maturity is 29%, and 33% for one week. \par \par \uc2  "Before Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  announced its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the overnight interest rate was between 25% and 29% for foreign banks," said a dealer at a local bank. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said banks shut down their trading lines with ailing small banks on rumors that a small bank failed to honor its interbank deal recently. \par \par \uc2  In the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets at the same time, the dollar was trading at IDR7,483, little changed from IDR7,500 in Asia late Thursday. \par \par \uc2  In the offshore swap market, the premium on the tomorrow/next day swap remained stable, at IDR5-IDR7. \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana (62-21) 3500145 imsentana@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 11-12-98 \par \par \uc2  0214GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010917ducb020yn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
