\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian Rupiah Lower Early As Dlr Up Vs Major  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 245 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 November 1998\par 03:08\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Indonesia's rupiah weakened slightly against the U.S. dollar in quiet dealings early Tuesday on the dollar's rise against major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and on improved rupiah liquidity, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  At 0157 GMT (8:57 p.m. EST), the dollar was trading at 7,650 rupiah (IDR), up from its close Monday at IDR7,525. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, the dollar was also trading at Y121.38, up from Y120.95 late Monday, and at DEM1.7054, higher than DEM1.7037 late Monday in New York. \par \par \uc2  "The dollar's sharp rise against the Deutsche mark and the yen affected the rupiah," said a dealer at a local bank. \par \par \uc2  Dealers added that ample liquidity of the rupiah sent the overnight interbank rate down to an intraday low of 5% for large banks from 30% late Monday. The sharp drop in interbank rate made the dollar more attractive than the rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Concerned with the sharp drop in the interbank rate, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the money market by buying the rupiah. The move lifted the overnight interbank rate back to 30%, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah is expected to trade in a narrow range Tuesday, between IDR7,500 and IDR7,700. \par \par \uc2  Trading remains quiet on a lack of interest in trading the rupiah. \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana; (62-21) 350 0145 imsentana@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 24-11-98 \par \par \uc2  0208GMT \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010917dubo01