\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia's Rupiah Little Changed Late In Quiet Dealings \b0\par\par\uc2 310 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 November 1998\par 10:56\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Indonesia's rupiah was little changed against the U.S. dollar in listless dealings late Tuesday on lack of speculative interest in the local unit, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was trading at 7,550 rupiah (IDR) at 0950 GMT, only a touch higher than its close Monday at IDR7,525 thanks to the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's bullishness against other major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "The rupiah was stable for most of the day as nobody wants to speculate ahead of the year end," said a dealer with a local bank. "Market players also choose to stay on the sidelines as the rupiah moves against their expectation despite the riots." \par \par \uc2  Dealers said that state and offshore banks sold the dollar, which they believed was on behalf of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Bank Indonesia. The dollar-selling helped the rupiah weather the dollar's rise against major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Market participants expect Bank Indonesia to continue selling the dollar in the market to keep the rupiah stable. \par \par \uc2  "The market perceives that Bank Indonesia is determined to keep the rupiah's stability and drive the rupiah higher gradually," a dealer with a foreign bank said. \par \par \uc2  The market's unwillingness to defy the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  as well as the lack of speculative interest is expected to keep the rupiah trading within a tight range Wednesday between IDR7,300 and IDR7,600 to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  Dealers added that rupiah liquidity was good Tuesday, keeping the overnight interbank interest rate unchanged at 30% for large banks. \par \par \uc2  The overnight rate jumped to 50% earlier in the day. But Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the money market by buying rupiah and pushed the overnight rupiah rate back to 30%. \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana; (62-21) 350 0145 imsentana@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 24-11-98 \par \par \uc2  0956GMT \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010917dubo01er6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
