\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia Rupiah Ends Slightly Weaker Due To Demonstrations \b0\par\par\uc2 308 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 November 1998\par 12:00\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--The Indonesian rupiah (IDR) ended Wednesday slightly weaker against the U.S. dollar in thin trade. It was boosted by the U.S. interest-rate cut early in the day but spooked by anti-government demonstrations later. \par \par \uc2  In late Asian trade, the rupiah was quoted at IDR7,600 to the dollar, weaker than its close in New York Tuesday at IDR7,450. Local markets were closed Tuesday for a holiday. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah strengthened early reaching an intraday high of IDR7,250 on the back of the U.S. Federal Reserve's 25-basis-point cut in interest rates overnight Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  But late afternoon demonstrations in Jakarta damped the bullish sentiment, raising fears of political instability. \par \par \uc2  "The demonstrations triggered some late short covering," said a dealer with a U.S. bank. \par \par \uc2  About 3,000 student protesters took to downtown streets in the capital late Wednesday in the biggest anti-government turnout since deadly clashes with the military last week. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the rupiah has shown remarkable resilience in the face of political disturbances, but attribute that largely to how thin the market is. \par \par \uc2  Many have suspected dollar selling by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Senior Economic Minister Ginandjar Kartasasmita Wednesday reiterated comments that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  won't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , regularly sells dollars in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, but doesn't call the action an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to boost the rupiah's value against the dollar. It says it is only exchanging dollars for rupiah to finance the budget deficit. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, interest rates at the weekly auction of one month \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  notes fell again to 49.66% from 51.16% last week. \par \par \uc2  -Kate Linebaugh; 62 21 350 0145; klinebaugh@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 18-11-98 \par \par \uc2  1100GMT \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010917dubi01b71\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
