\par\par \b \uc2  SE Asian  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2  -4: Peso Bulls Seen Charging Wrong Way \b0\par\par\uc2 256 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 November 1998\par 11:41\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Most market participants remain bullish on the peso, saying foreign direct investment and remittances from expatriate Filipinos will bolster the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  over the coming months. According to Basu at CSFB, however, that optimism may be sorely misplaced. \par \par \uc2  "The Philippine peso is by far the most vulnerable \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Asia," he said, asserting the contrarian view. \par \par \uc2  Basu points to a current account that is barely in balance, the high level of banks' net foreign liabilities relative to the overall size of their balance sheets, and foreign reserves, which at $7.7 billion, he describes as "puny", compared with the Philippines' levels of short term debt. \par \par \uc2  "The Philippines' external balances are very precariously perched and could easily be tipped over the edge," he warned. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah's strength on Wednesday was attributed to sales of the U.S. dollar by state banks in Jakarta. Although Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  declared that it was not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market, traders in Singapore and Hong Kong insisted that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been active in recent days, selling the U.S. dollar to stabilize the rupiah as political tension in Indonesia mounts. Apart from the state banks, said traders, few other players dared to risk entering the market. \par \par \uc2  "Investors will only begin to look at the rupiah again when the process of political change is complete. Until then we won't see any sustainable inflow of foreign funds," said Fong at Nomura. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires  11-11-98 \par \par \uc2  0541EST \par \par \uc2  1136 4250 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020010916dubb02mjv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
