\par\par \b \uc2  Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2 /Cap Controls -3: Says Not  \highlight22\uc2 Intervening \highlight\uc2  In Mkt \b0\par\par\uc2 224 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 September 1998\par 08:17\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Since Malaysia implemented sweeping capital controls last week, market participants have speculated that Indonesia may follow suit with some form of controlled system, although the government and Bank Indonesia officials deny this. \par \par \uc2  Indonesia operated a form of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  control during the late 1960s and early 1970s. That system led to a black market in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and smuggling and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  eventually abandoned it. \par \par \uc2  Given the sprawling nature of the country and its myriad of islands, Indonesia isn't seen as being in a position to enforce capital controls in any case. \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia has said it would consider some form of managed exchange rate system for the rupiah, however, which many market operators say it will eventually have to do to better support the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Elsehwere, Sjahril said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was exchanging between $5 and $15 million a day for rupiah in the spot market. He said the funds were part of international lending to \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The governor said this wasn't market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , however. \par \par \uc2  "The bank is not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2 , just supplying money to the market for exports or imports," Sjahril said. He said the amount of dollars supplied to the market daily will depend on the amount of foreign aid released. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 10-09-98 \par \par \uc2  0617GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du9a07rz3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
