\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2 / \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Reserves -2: Down On  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 167 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 September 1998\par 03:12\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , said late Wednesday that the country's net \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves fell slightly to $13.5 billion as of Aug. 31 from $13.7 billion Aug. 21. \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia said the slight fall was because of the payment of interest for the government's offshore debts as well as \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to absorb excess rupiah liquidity. \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia added that Indonesia's gross \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves, however, rose to $19.9 billion from $19.1 billion. \par \par \uc2  The absorption of excess rupiah liquidity through \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market as well as the auction of Sertifikat Bank Indonesia (SBI) reduce the amount of primary money by 435 billion rupiah (IDR) to IDR68.6 billion. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, Bank Indonesia liquidity support to banks rose to IDR141.5 trillion from IDR140.8 trillion. \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana; 6221 350 0145; imsentana@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 03-09-98 \par \par \uc2  0112GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du9307j2t\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
