\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian Rupiah Up Slightly Late On State Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 300 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 August 1998\par 11:41\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--The Indonesian rupiah was up slightly late Tuesday despite sliding regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , with \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by state-owned banks lending support to the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  At 0851 GMT (4:51 a.m. EDT), the rupiah was quoted at 13,050 rupiah (IDR) to the dollar, slightly up from IDR13,100 late Monday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said trading was thin, with concerns about further weakening of regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in particular the yen and the possible devaluation of the Chinese yuan, keeping investors clear of the rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the state-owned banks stepped into the market when the rupiah was at IDR13,100 and offered to sell the dollar at IDR13,050. \par \par \uc2  "The amount is quite small. I guess it's roughly US$15 million to US$25 million," said a dealer at a Japanese bank. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , wasn't seen directly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Sjahril Sabirin said earlier Tuesday that the bank would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market regularly to boost the rupiah. He said the bank had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  Monday. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, although there was little movement in the spot market, market players have been positioning themselves in the swap market ahead of the auction of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  notes on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia said earlier it aimed to raise IDR13 trillion via the auction of its one-month Sertifikat Bank Indonesia (SBI) notes. \par \par \uc2  "Banks have been borrowing from the swap market to get funds to bid for the SBI. And the swap rate has gone up since Monday," the dealer said. Last week the notes were auctioned at a weighted average yield of 68.3%. \par \par \uc2  -By Noel Fung; 6221-350-0150; nfung@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 11-08-98 \par \par \uc2  0941GMT \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du8b06uy2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
