\par\par \b \uc2  Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2 /Regularly  \highlight22\uc2 Intervene \highlight\uc2  -3: Tight Monetary Policy \b0\par\par\uc2 255 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 August 1998\par 07:22\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Sjahril also reiterated the bank would maintain a tight monetary policy, also to boost the rupiah. \par \par \uc2  At 0508 GMT Tuesday, the dollar is fetching IDR12,975, down from IDR13,100 late Monday in Asia. \par \par \uc2  Under Indonesia's agreement with the International Monetary Fund, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has pledged to keep interest rates high to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Its tight monetary policy has thus far failed to strengthen the rupiah significantly, however. \par \par \uc2  Sjahril said the full implementation of the Frankfurt agreement between Indonesian debtors and international banks to reschedule private sector debt was also crucial to lend support to the rupiah. \par \par \uc2  He said once the agreement is in place "offshore banks will reopen credit lines to Indonesia." \par \par \uc2  The Indonesian Debt Restructuring Agency - set up under the Frankfurt agreement - opened for business last week, although no Indonesian debtors have yet joined or even pledged to join. \par \par \uc2  The agency outlines a way to reschedule foreign private debt, thus offering some breathing space to the nation's cash-strapped companies and its shaky \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  The pact offers a voluntary program to debt-laden companies under which their obligations will be extended by eight years and under which they will receive access to dollars at a locked-in rate - set last week at 13,233 rupiah to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  The continued free-fall of the rupiah against the dollar, however, has prompted many companies to question the merits of entering the agreement. \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 11-08-98 \par \par \uc2  0522GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du8b06tj2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
