\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian Rupiah Dn Mid-Morning On Weak Yen In Thin Trading \b0\par\par\uc2 290 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 August 1998\par 06:10\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--The weakening yen and the holiday in Singapore have damped trading in the Indonesian rupiah Monday morning. \par \par \uc2  At 0336 GMT (11:36 p.m. EDT Sunday), the rupiah was quoted at 13,000 rupiah to the U.S. dollar, weaker than its Friday close of IDR12,750. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the trading volume was thin and there were not many players in the market because Singapore is closed for its national day holiday. \par \par \uc2  "The trading is so thin that it is hard to see a real price (for the rupiah)," said a dealer at an American bank. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the rupiah's movement was in line with the declining Japanese yen, which broke through Y146 to the dollar early Monday. \par \par \uc2  The weak yen has sent ripples through the rest of the region, bringing the spotlight to the Chinese yuan and the Hong Kong dollar as speculation of a possible devaluation of the two \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  mounts. \par \par \uc2  State-owned banks were seen offering U.S. dollars at the IDR13,000 level but the amount was quite small, they said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which was spotted \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market last Thursday and Friday, was not seen Monday morning. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said that if the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  again, the rupiah may strengthen to IDR12,700. \par \par \uc2  "I reckon the amount the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  used last week was very small, probably less than US$50 million," the dealer said. \par \par \uc2  He expected the rupiah to trade within the range of IDR12,700 to IDR13,200 for the rest of the day. \par \par \uc2  -By Noel Fung; 6221-350-0150; nfung@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 10-08-98 \par \par \uc2  0410GMT \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du8a06qpp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
