\par\par \b \uc2  Bk Indonesia To Provide Dlrs For Trade Financing Arrears \b0\par\par\uc2 190 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 Juni 1998\par 13:52\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Indonesia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will provide U.S. dollars to Indonesian banks, who will settle their trade financing arrears this month in order to mitigate the upward pressure on the dollar, Bank Indonesia Syahril Sabirin said Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Syahril made the statement to answer a question if Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to boost the plummeting rupiah. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah has been falling more than 16% since Tuesday as local banks have to pay their interbank debt and trade financing arrears by a new June 26 deadline. The arrears amounted to an estimated $800 million. \par \par \uc2  "As long as the dollar is needed for trade financing, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will provide the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to the banks," said Syahril. "That is how we \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market." \par \par \uc2  He, however, did not elaborate how Bank Indonesia will provide the dollars to banks. \par \par \uc2  Bankers have suggested that Bank Indonesia provide the dollars through swap facilities. \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia has said earlier that it will take over the payment of the arrears if banks are unable to do so. \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 17-06-98 \par \par \uc2  1152GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du6h056js\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
