\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia Min-2: No Net Rupiah Creation Via Domestic Ops \b0\par\par\uc2  By Richard Borsuk \par \uc2 212 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 Mai 1998\par 07:45\par \uc2  Dow Jones Asian Equities Report \par \uc2 AER\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Indonesia's top economics minister pledged that the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  won't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to support the rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Ginanadjar Kartasasmita, coordinating minister for the economy, finance and industry, told Dow Jones Newswrires Friday that Bank Indonesia 'will not risk its international reserves speculating in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.' \par \par \uc2  The minister, who negotiating Indonesia's latest agreement with the International Monetary Fund, said that last year 'we bled ourselves of $10 billion (in reserves) to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , without any success.' \par \par \uc2  Ginandjar said the rupiah has strengthened considerably since early March 'without any \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ', which he says reflects better sentiment about \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  and belief it will seriously undertake reform. Many bankers, however, say they believe it's Indonesia's high interest rates that have contributed the most to strengthening the rupiah from around IDR10,000 in early March. \par \par \uc2  He also said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  won't 'create new rupiah' in net terms through its domestic \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Many bankers have expressed concern that Bank Indonesia has pumped tens of trillions of rupiah into Indonesian banks since last year to support the country's battered banking sector. \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires  01-05-98 \par \par \uc2  0545GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument aer0000020010914du5100h2s\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
