\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia Min-2: No Net Rupiah Creation Via Domestic Ops \b0\par\par\uc2  By Richard Borsuk \par \uc2 212 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 Mai 1998\par 07:45\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Indonesia's top economics minister pledged that the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  won't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to support the rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Ginanadjar Kartasasmita, coordinating minister for the economy, finance and industry, told Dow Jones Newswrires Friday that Bank Indonesia 'will not risk its international reserves speculating in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.' \par \par \uc2  The minister, who negotiating Indonesia's latest agreement with the International Monetary Fund, said that last year 'we bled ourselves of $10 billion (in reserves) to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , without any success.' \par \par \uc2  Ginandjar said the rupiah has strengthened considerably since early March 'without any \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ', which he says reflects better sentiment about \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  and belief it will seriously undertake reform. Many bankers, however, say they believe it's Indonesia's high interest rates that have contributed the most to strengthening the rupiah from around IDR10,000 in early March. \par \par \uc2  He also said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  won't 'create new rupiah' in net terms through its domestic \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Many bankers have expressed concern that Bank Indonesia has pumped tens of trillions of rupiah into Indonesian banks since last year to support the country's battered banking sector. \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 01-05-98 \par \par \uc2  0545GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du5103ogn\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (indonesia near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Datum\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 01/01/1995 bis 21/08/2023\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Quelle\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\a